Isolated majority-carrier temperature mobility
* Provenance: original Sansho R20b black-box experiment.
* sweep: temperature 0 27 55 85 110
* Use the on/off ratio at fixed small field to remove charge density and geometry.
.param probe=0
Vdrive drive 0 0
.temp {probe}
Voff drive node_off 0
Doff node_off 0 moff
.model moff numd level=1
+ options resistor defa=1e-8
+ x.mesh loc=0 n=1
+ x.mesh loc=2.4 n=62
+ domain num=1 material=1
+ material num=1 silicon
+ doping uniform n.type conc=1e16
+ end
Von drive node_on 0
Don node_on 0 mon
.model mon numd level=1
+ options resistor defa=1e-8
+ x.mesh loc=0 n=1
+ x.mesh loc=2.4 n=62
+ domain num=1 material=1
+ material num=1 silicon
+ doping uniform n.type conc=1e16
+ models tempmob
+ end
.options itl1=200 itl2=120 reltol=1e-5 abstol=1e-15
.dc Vdrive -0.01 0.01 0.005
.save i(voff) i(von)
.end
